265676 1145 "First, we rearrange the equation and isolate $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+2\\sqrt{3} & =-5\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 7\\operatorname{tan}⁡x & =-7\\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡x & =-\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find the principal value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-\\sqrt{3})=-\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $-\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ lies outside the given domain, it is not a solution.\n\nTo generate more solutions, we add integer multiples of $\\pi .$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =\\pi +x=\\pi +(-\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\frac{2\\pi }{3}, \\\\ {x}_{2} & =2\\pi +x=2\\pi +(-\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\frac{5\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solutions are $x=\\frac{2\\pi }{3},\\frac{5\\pi }{3}.$" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265678 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265679 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265680 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265681 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265682 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1041 "selection" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1104 #edb/ref 17592186265678 13194139533917 true] [17592186265677 1110 #uuid "ecb8e0f4-e168-500b-bf2b-e5e2dcb5f9aa" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265678 1034 "x=\\frac{2\\pi }{3},\\frac{5\\pi }{3}" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265678 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533917 true] [17592186265678 1111 #uuid "c9a1e997-df29-5cf1-951f-f9868235631f" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265679 1034 "x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533917 true] [17592186265679 1111 #uuid "0e7952ae-af35-5750-a059-6b2e161687a1" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265680 1034 "x=\\frac{5\\pi }{6}" 13194139533917 true] [17592186265680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131941